# NestJS — صف‌شکن

- NestJS 12. Controller to service. One feature module per capability under `apps/backend/src`.
- Domain types come from `@saf-shekan/core`. DTOs mirror those shapes with `class-validator`.
- Broker config is a JSON file on disk. There is no database, Prisma, TypeORM, Passport, JWT auth, multi-tenant filter, BullMQ, or microservice split in this app.
- If a vendored Nest skill recommends those, ignore it here.
- Only `EnvModule` is `@Global()`. Other modules export what they own and are imported explicitly.
- `engine/domain` does not import `@nestjs/*` or `undici`.
- Vitest. Do not hit a live broker or TSETMC host from tests.
